WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.920
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:25.190 --> 00:29.330
[Live Forever]

3
00:30.390 --> 00:32.940
[Episode 16]

4
00:33.380 --> 00:34.660
As long as he dies,

5
00:34.880 --> 00:36.390
you two will love each other forever.

6
00:36.390 --> 00:38.840
Then my sister's sacrifice won't be in vain.

7
00:38.840 --> 00:39.710
Xiao He!

8
01:09.200 --> 01:10.150
Sister!

9
01:13.150 --> 01:14.039
Sister!

10
01:15.039 --> 01:15.920
Sister!

11
01:17.550 --> 01:21.640
♪ I was here ♪

12
01:18.400 --> 01:19.350
Sister.

13
01:21.350 --> 01:22.150
Qiu.

14
01:21.990 --> 01:29.350
♪ Now I have to go ♪

15
01:28.280 --> 01:29.120
Xiao He.

16
01:31.000 --> 01:32.000
Sister!

17
01:35.070 --> 01:36.680
You're alive!

18
01:39.140 --> 01:40.620
You've grown up.

19
01:45.200 --> 01:46.950
What did I tell you?

20
01:48.200 --> 01:49.450
What are we?

21
01:51.090 --> 01:54.450
We are Tree Spirits.

22
01:53.530 --> 01:56.420
♪ I won't fall in a cage ♪

23
01:56.000 --> 01:57.310
We can't hurt people.

24
01:57.140 --> 01:59.020
♪ Missing old days ♪

25
01:57.789 --> 01:59.280
Then what are you doing right now?

26
01:59.220 --> 02:01.230
♪ I'll be there ♪

27
01:59.280 --> 01:59.759
I...

28
02:01.000 --> 02:01.870
But...

29
02:01.320 --> 02:05.270
♪ I will hold my ground here ♪

30
02:02.680 --> 02:04.710
But he took you away first!

31
02:04.710 --> 02:06.510
He separated us!

32
02:06.020 --> 02:08.520
♪ Let others say what they please ♪

33
02:07.920 --> 02:10.190
General Yu from the past is already dead.

34
02:08.990 --> 02:11.520
♪ The road ahead holds a bright scenery ♪

35
02:11.400 --> 02:13.280
Now he is Lin Huai.

36
02:11.540 --> 02:17.720
♪ I stop right here ♪

37
02:13.870 --> 02:15.310
If you kill him,

38
02:15.630 --> 02:17.800
you'll only add to your own sins.

39
02:18.120 --> 02:18.910
But...

40
02:19.260 --> 02:21.370
But he destroyed everything we had!

41
02:20.510 --> 02:24.220
♪ Now I have to go ♪

42
02:21.710 --> 02:23.520
He destroyed the lover you blessed!

43
02:23.520 --> 02:25.560
He destroyed our home!

44
02:24.570 --> 02:30.040
♪ I will live on ♪

45
02:27.360 --> 02:29.000
I just want you to be safe.

46
02:32.190 --> 02:37.540
♪ Let others say what they please ♪

47
02:42.280 --> 02:43.680
You got your memory back?

48
02:45.680 --> 02:47.190
To be precise,

49
02:47.190 --> 02:48.579
it's the me from my past life.

50
02:48.579 --> 02:50.090
We osmanthus Tree Spirits

51
02:50.190 --> 02:52.960
only form our spirit cores

52
02:53.190 --> 02:54.800
after waking from chaos to understand the world.

53
02:54.800 --> 02:56.329
If the core leaves the body,

54
02:56.480 --> 02:58.200
we must return to our roots

55
02:58.220 --> 02:59.650
and wait to sprout again.

56
03:01.360 --> 03:02.400
That's nice.

57
03:03.400 --> 03:05.560
Life and death are in your own hands.

58
03:06.840 --> 03:08.000
But...

59
03:09.080 --> 03:11.610
the power of immortality in you and Song Yiqiu

60
03:11.870 --> 03:13.190
is fading.

61
03:15.760 --> 03:19.160
Is it because the painting Autumn Moon in the Forest bloomed?

62
03:20.710 --> 03:23.430
From the moment it bloomed,

63
03:23.550 --> 03:26.060
time for you and Song Yiqiu was released.

64
03:26.310 --> 03:27.870
The more flowers bloom,

65
03:27.920 --> 03:29.730
the closer you get to the end.

66
03:34.720 --> 03:35.770
I regret it.

67
03:36.800 --> 03:38.240
You regret it?

68
03:39.150 --> 03:41.350
Regret falling in love with Song Yiqiu?

69
03:42.970 --> 03:44.570
Regret loving her and

70
03:46.040 --> 03:47.570
ending the immortality...

71
03:48.170 --> 03:48.890
Do you know?

72
03:51.190 --> 03:52.590
When she lay in my arms,

73
03:53.000 --> 03:54.480
her wound not healing,

74
03:54.500 --> 03:55.710
bleeding endlessly,

75
03:57.840 --> 03:58.960
I finally realized

76
04:00.310 --> 04:02.750
how cruel ending immortality is.

77
04:03.780 --> 04:05.180
For the past 3,000 years,

78
04:05.690 --> 04:07.060
we only parted in life.

79
04:09.960 --> 04:11.290
But in the years to come,

80
04:12.430 --> 04:14.560
we will eventually be parted by death.

81
04:15.400 --> 04:17.269
So 3,000 years of time

82
04:18.120 --> 04:20.190
didn't make you happy.

83
04:22.240 --> 04:23.040
If only...

84
04:24.140 --> 04:26.520
If only you could live like ordinary people,

85
04:26.520 --> 04:28.920
experiencing birth, aging, sickness, and death...

86
04:28.920 --> 04:31.750
maybe you could love and stay together like before,

87
04:31.750 --> 04:33.070
and grow old together.

88
04:38.720 --> 04:40.270
Maybe if I stop now,

89
04:41.400 --> 04:42.640
there's still time.

90
05:54.480 --> 05:55.310
Sister,

91
05:55.830 --> 05:57.690
you will definitely love it here.

92
05:58.230 --> 05:59.960
There are flowers everywhere.

93
06:00.310 --> 06:02.640
They call it landscaping.

94
06:06.590 --> 06:07.390
Sister,

95
06:08.250 --> 06:10.010
I saw them today.

96
06:10.510 --> 06:11.800
That pair of lovers.

97
06:12.820 --> 06:13.850
The ones

98
06:13.950 --> 06:16.270
you blessed with your spirit core.

99
06:26.380 --> 06:27.020
Sister,

100
06:27.590 --> 06:30.250
I learned a new way to weave flower crowns today.

101
06:50.570 --> 06:51.330
Sister!

102
06:55.320 --> 06:56.240
Xiao He.

103
07:03.720 --> 07:06.070
I thought you were going to leave me again.

104
07:06.800 --> 07:08.720
Why are you crying again?

105
07:09.050 --> 07:10.560
I'm right here, aren't I?

106
07:14.770 --> 07:16.290
I saw this.

107
07:16.520 --> 07:17.920
When I tried to teach you as a kid,

108
07:17.920 --> 07:19.110
you wouldn't learn.

109
07:19.360 --> 07:21.160
Now you figured it out yourself.

110
07:22.070 --> 07:23.390
Still as cute as ever.

111
07:25.010 --> 07:26.370
Not as cute as you.

112
07:32.070 --> 07:34.480
All of his vitals are returning to normal.

113
07:35.760 --> 07:37.360
Medically speaking,

114
07:37.659 --> 07:39.010
he's out of danger.

115
07:39.720 --> 07:41.320
But he still hasn't woken up.

116
07:41.840 --> 07:42.580
It's been so long.

117
07:42.580 --> 07:43.840
Why isn't he awake yet?

118
07:45.590 --> 07:46.980
That's the problem.

119
07:47.510 --> 07:49.170
His cerebral cortex activity

120
07:49.720 --> 07:51.920
is higher than a normal state.

121
07:53.510 --> 07:54.540
To be precise,

122
07:55.310 --> 07:56.370
his consciousness

123
07:56.830 --> 07:58.560
is fighting against waking up.

124
08:00.310 --> 08:01.230
I see.

125
08:02.930 --> 08:03.850
Got it.

126
08:04.190 --> 08:05.250
Thank you, doctor.

127
08:05.950 --> 08:07.120
Talk to him more.

128
08:07.140 --> 08:08.510
Call me if you need anything.

129
08:08.510 --> 08:09.150
Thanks.

130
08:38.630 --> 08:39.440
Mr. Ning.

131
08:40.370 --> 08:41.429
Manager Qing Yuan,

132
08:41.630 --> 08:42.409
why are you here?

133
08:42.409 --> 08:44.020
I heard Miss Song was ill,

134
08:44.240 --> 08:46.570
so I came by on behalf of the auction house.

135
08:47.010 --> 08:48.410
Just a little something.

136
08:50.000 --> 08:50.600
Thank you.

137
08:54.120 --> 08:55.320
Miss Song is

138
08:55.750 --> 08:57.210
recovering very quickly.

139
08:57.510 --> 08:59.570
She's already out of bed and walking.

140
09:00.030 --> 09:01.000
The one

141
09:02.200 --> 09:03.660
lying there is...

142
09:05.140 --> 09:06.870
Director Lin was also injured?

143
09:08.830 --> 09:09.810
They were robbed on the road.

144
09:09.810 --> 09:11.330
They were just startled.

145
09:11.360 --> 09:13.560
They didn't suffer any major injuries.

146
09:13.570 --> 09:15.030
Good to hear they're okay.

147
09:16.910 --> 09:17.750
So,

148
09:18.270 --> 09:20.670
Miss Song and Director Lin are quite close.

149
09:21.420 --> 09:24.030
The way she looks at him is very different.

150
09:24.390 --> 09:25.070
Looks like

151
09:25.400 --> 09:28.160
you have some strong competition.

152
09:32.700 --> 09:36.230
In an auction, the highest bidder wins.

153
09:37.140 --> 09:38.320
But in love,

154
09:39.000 --> 09:41.460
sometimes it's not about who bids the highest,

155
09:41.460 --> 09:42.430
but about

156
09:42.800 --> 09:44.440
who is more sincere.

157
09:45.250 --> 09:46.250
Good luck to you.

158
09:51.760 --> 09:52.600
Lin Huai.

159
10:02.320 --> 10:03.120
Lin Huai,

160
10:04.720 --> 10:05.670
do you know that

161
10:07.270 --> 10:08.200
when I saw you again,

162
10:08.200 --> 10:10.320
looking so free and vibrant,

163
10:11.720 --> 10:12.910
I was so happy?

164
10:15.200 --> 10:15.960
Because

165
10:17.120 --> 10:18.790
this is the life your past self

166
10:18.830 --> 10:20.920
fought so hard for.

167
10:21.000 --> 10:22.000
It's so great!

168
10:22.600 --> 10:23.630
You're warm,

169
10:24.630 --> 10:25.630
and alive.

170
10:27.620 --> 10:29.220
It's so great.

171
10:32.750 --> 10:34.030
But I didn't expect

172
10:35.870 --> 10:37.480
that you, like us,

173
10:40.620 --> 10:43.190
have been trapped for 3,000 years.

174
10:44.360 --> 10:45.790
None of us are

175
10:47.480 --> 10:48.790
truly living,

176
10:51.640 --> 10:53.240
nor have we ever truly lived.

177
10:55.930 --> 10:57.800
Forget all this, Lin Huai.

178
10:59.320 --> 11:01.010
When you wake up this time,

179
11:04.750 --> 11:06.540
just be the Lin Huai you are now.

180
11:08.510 --> 11:10.030
I hope in this lifetime,

181
11:13.200 --> 11:15.030
you can live your life well.

182
11:16.670 --> 11:18.200
Enjoy your life.

183
11:47.280 --> 11:48.070
Qiu.

184
11:52.540 --> 11:53.920
Qing Yuan from the auction house

185
11:53.920 --> 11:54.780
came to see you.

186
11:55.390 --> 11:57.140
Here are the flowers and fruits she brought.

187
11:57.140 --> 11:58.810
Word travels fast with them.

188
12:01.630 --> 12:02.440
Qiu,

189
12:03.910 --> 12:06.170
you're not recovering as fast as before.

190
12:07.190 --> 12:09.120
Please take good care of yourself.

191
12:14.080 --> 12:14.940
Ning Changyue,

192
12:17.990 --> 12:19.150
let's talk.

193
12:24.950 --> 12:25.590
No rush.

194
12:26.090 --> 12:28.150
We can talk after you're discharged.

195
12:31.770 --> 12:32.650
Ning Changyue!

196
12:33.910 --> 12:35.310
I'll go buy you some food.

197
13:06.180 --> 13:07.710
Where's my osmanthus cake?

198
13:07.790 --> 13:08.480
I ate it.

199
13:08.660 --> 13:09.460
Buy some more.

200
13:09.540 --> 13:10.540
Go buy it!

201
13:11.360 --> 13:12.160
Beg me.

202
13:23.200 --> 13:25.410
Ning, we're back!

203
13:28.080 --> 13:28.910
Where is he?

204
13:30.070 --> 13:31.220
Upstairs maybe?

205
13:32.400 --> 13:33.200
Ning!

206
13:43.270 --> 13:43.670
Qiu,

207
13:44.360 --> 13:45.390
his things are gone.

208
13:45.390 --> 13:47.190
His phone won't connect either.

209
13:52.910 --> 13:54.680
Your collection has been sold.

210
13:55.080 --> 13:58.010
The proceeds have been deposited into your account.

211
13:58.590 --> 13:59.650
Manager Qing Yuan,

212
13:59.860 --> 14:00.770
do me a favor.

213
14:01.470 --> 14:02.070
I

214
14:03.240 --> 14:04.570
have to go on a long trip.

215
14:05.680 --> 14:06.680
I have some pieces

216
14:06.870 --> 14:09.130
I'd like the auction house to sell for me.

217
14:09.430 --> 14:11.000
Sure, Mr. Ning.

218
14:11.400 --> 14:12.360
When the time comes,

219
14:12.360 --> 14:14.320
the funds will be deposited

220
14:14.320 --> 14:15.880
into the account you left with us.

221
14:15.880 --> 14:17.850
Deposit it into Song Yiqiu's account.

222
14:17.850 --> 14:18.640
Okay.

223
14:23.050 --> 14:25.380
Pulling this trick again, Ning Changyue.

224
14:30.720 --> 14:31.390
Qiu.

225
14:46.020 --> 14:47.450
You're quite generous.

226
15:05.320 --> 15:05.670
Qiu,

227
15:06.240 --> 15:07.310
everything's done.

228
15:07.310 --> 15:08.170
I'm exhausted.

229
15:08.390 --> 15:09.480
Moving all this stuff here...

230
15:09.480 --> 15:10.080
I'm telling you,

231
15:10.080 --> 15:11.120
was no joke.

232
15:12.600 --> 15:13.360
But

233
15:13.600 --> 15:15.390
why did we move them to the riverbank?

234
15:15.390 --> 15:17.390
In this weather, they'll get damp easily.

235
15:17.390 --> 15:18.360
These are antique trunks.

236
15:18.360 --> 15:19.990
They shouldn't touch the ground for too long.

237
15:19.990 --> 15:20.590
By the way,

238
15:20.750 --> 15:21.630
does Ning know?

239
15:22.040 --> 15:23.470
Should we let him know?

240
15:23.840 --> 15:24.630
Open them.

241
15:24.930 --> 15:26.050
Open them? Okay.

242
15:31.890 --> 15:32.370
This...

243
15:32.400 --> 15:33.080
Qiu,

244
15:33.750 --> 15:35.870
all these things look so valuable!

245
15:35.870 --> 15:36.800
Throw them away.

246
15:39.000 --> 15:39.930
Throw them away?

247
15:41.270 --> 15:41.750
Wait,

248
15:42.080 --> 15:42.510
Qiu,

249
15:42.720 --> 15:43.750
could this be some...

250
15:43.750 --> 15:45.550
Southern Qin bronze ware?

251
15:45.640 --> 15:47.240
No, we can't throw this away.

252
15:48.460 --> 15:49.150
Wait,

253
15:49.170 --> 15:49.720
Qiu.

254
15:49.750 --> 15:51.370
Why are you throwing away all these treasures?

255
15:51.370 --> 15:52.250
Don't!

256
15:53.150 --> 15:54.080
This is worth a lot of money!

257
15:54.080 --> 15:54.390
Seriously,

258
15:54.390 --> 15:55.200
why are you throwing away

259
15:55.200 --> 15:56.410
such precious things?

260
15:56.410 --> 15:57.980
Both of you think these are treasures.

261
15:57.980 --> 15:59.220
Then you take them!

262
16:00.510 --> 16:00.990
But...

263
16:13.470 --> 16:14.600
Okay, let's dump them...

264
16:14.600 --> 16:15.360
dump them.

265
16:15.670 --> 16:16.270
All of them.

266
16:16.270 --> 16:17.000
Don't worry.

267
16:18.630 --> 16:21.270
I... I'll help you throw them?

268
16:21.390 --> 16:23.150
Tang Dynasty pearls?

269
16:23.150 --> 16:24.200
Throw away?

270
16:26.080 --> 16:26.750
This...

271
16:27.240 --> 16:30.670
This is top-tier yellow jade from the Song Dynasty.

272
16:31.140 --> 16:32.210
Throw this too.

273
16:33.360 --> 16:34.550
This whistle...

274
16:34.910 --> 16:36.610
Can't really tell what this is.

275
16:36.610 --> 16:38.420
This is Song... Song Dynasty?

276
16:39.290 --> 16:41.260
Tang Dynasty? Song Dynasty?

277
16:42.840 --> 16:44.030
Stupid brain, think fast!

278
16:44.030 --> 16:45.270
Think fast!

279
16:45.270 --> 16:46.470
What dynasty is this?

280
17:10.930 --> 17:14.530
♪ Hard to write destiny in a few scrolls ♪

281
17:14.560 --> 17:16.670
♪ Karma remains incomplete ♪

282
17:17.260 --> 17:21.030
♪ Past memories burn to ashes at sunset ♪

283
17:21.050 --> 17:23.980
♪ Cooling the old window sill ♪

284
17:24.800 --> 17:28.730
♪ Gazing across lifetimes the obsession won't break ♪

285
17:28.750 --> 17:31.380
♪ Who can bear the regret? ♪

286
17:30.000 --> 17:31.460
Over the past 3,000 years,

287
17:31.610 --> 17:35.360
♪ Three thousand years can't solve this game ♪

288
17:31.680 --> 17:33.480
the mementos you casually tossed aside

289
17:33.480 --> 17:35.350
or were forced to leave behind...

290
17:35.390 --> 17:38.990
♪ Unwillingness in the cycle of reincarnation ♪

291
17:36.400 --> 17:37.800
whatever I could recover

292
17:39.020 --> 17:41.050
♪ Watching time flow ♪

293
17:39.110 --> 17:40.110
is all right here.

294
17:41.070 --> 17:42.950
♪ Hearing the years sigh softly ♪

295
17:42.980 --> 17:45.740
♪ Immortality still cannot bring fulfillment ♪

296
17:45.770 --> 17:47.930
♪ Let fate tear everything apart ♪

297
17:45.880 --> 17:47.110
Call me anytime.

298
17:47.950 --> 17:49.830
♪ Our bond exists only because ♪

299
17:49.850 --> 17:52.960
♪ I don't want to leave regrets behind ♪

300
17:52.000 --> 17:53.640
So this is what you meant by...

301
17:53.340 --> 17:55.360
♪ Willing to give up immortality ♪

302
17:54.400 --> 17:56.830
our shared memories from the past 3,000 years.

303
17:55.390 --> 17:57.150
♪ To face hardships together ♪

304
17:57.190 --> 18:00.160
♪ Don't ask how absurd the ending may be ♪

305
18:00.190 --> 18:02.480
♪ I only want to use this lifetime ♪

306
18:02.500 --> 18:05.860
♪ To trade it for eternity ♪

307
18:05.880 --> 18:09.490
♪ Could we find our happy ending? ♪

308
19:03.500 --> 19:05.450
I thought you'd never blow it again.
